---
import WhatsappUI from "./WhatsappUI.astro";
---

<section id="qualificacao" class="qualification-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">PRÉ-VENDA & QUALIFICAÇÃO</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Sua equipe recebe o cliente <br />
        <span class="highlight">já sabendo o que ele quer.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Enquanto conversa, a IA entende o que importa, monta o card no CRM e avisa o vendedor no celular com o contexto necessário para continuar.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2-Column Aligned Layout -->
    <div class="section-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Chat -->
      <div class="grid-col-left">
        <div class="col-header-tag">CONVERSA ACONTECENDO</div>
        <WhatsappUI contactName="Imobiliária Horizonte" contactStatus="online agora" avatarUrl="/images/people/mariana.jpg">
          <div data-chat-playback data-chat-loop class="qualification-chat">
          <div class="wa-bubble incoming" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="150">
            oi, o apê da rua das acácias ainda tá disponível?<br />vi no story
            <span class="wa-meta">10:24</span>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-typing" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="950"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <div class="wa-bubble outgoing" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="1750">
            Está sim. É o de 2 quartos com sacada, no terceiro andar. Era esse mesmo?
            <span class="wa-meta">10:25 <span class="wa-checks">✓✓</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-bubble incoming" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="2850">
            esse! a gente tá de aluguel e precisa mudar até outubro<br />tenho um menino pequeno, queria evitar escada
            <span class="wa-meta">10:27</span>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-typing" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="3600"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <div class="wa-bubble outgoing" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="4400">
            Ele tem elevador e a garagem fica no mesmo nível da entrada. O valor é R$ 420 mil e aceita financiamento. Quer visitar sábado depois das 10h?
            <span class="wa-meta">10:28 <span class="wa-checks">✓✓</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-bubble incoming" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="5650">
            10:30 pode ser<br />antes só queria confirmar se dá pra usar o fgts
            <span class="wa-meta">10:29</span>
          </div>
          </div>
        </WhatsappUI>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Ficha Pronta no Estilo do Kanban (Mesmo Estilo do Kanban em 1 Card Só) -->
      <div class="grid-col-right">
        <div class="col-header-tag purple-tag">CARD SENDO ORGANIZADO NO CRM</div>
        
        <!-- Kanban Stage Column (Estilo Idêntico ao Kanban da Outra Etapa) -->
        <div class="kanban-stage-column" data-chat-playback data-chat-loop>
          <div class="seller-notification" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="5200">
            <span class="notify-icon">DJ</span>
            <div><small>Daniel Junior CRM · agora</small><strong>Novo cliente pronto para continuar</strong></div>
          </div>
          <header class="kanban-stage-header">
            <span class="stage-dot-purple"></span>
            <strong>Visita a confirmar</strong>
            <span class="stage-count">1</span>
          </header>

          <!-- Single Clean White Kanban Card -->
          <div class="kanban-deal-card featured-card" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="500">
            <div class="card-user-row" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="1300">
              <img src="/images/people/mariana.jpg" alt="Mariana Costa" class="deal-avatar" />
              <div>
                <strong>Mariana Souza</strong>
                <small>WhatsApp · Apartamento 2 quartos</small>
              </div>
              <span class="deal-tag purple-tag">Visita</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Executive IA Summary Quote -->
            <div class="card-summary-quote" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="2300">
              <span class="quote-label">RESUMO DA IA</span>
              <p>Mariana mora de aluguel e precisa mudar até outubro. Gostou do apartamento da Rua das Acácias porque tem elevador e aceita financiamento. Quer visitar sábado às 10h30 e perguntou sobre uso do FGTS.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Lead Meta Chips -->
            <div class="card-chips-row" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="3300">
              <span class="chip">Até outubro</span>
              <span class="chip">Financiamento</span>
              <span class="chip">Sábado · 10h30</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Assignment Footer -->
            <div class="card-footer-assign" data-chat-step data-chat-delay="4200">
              <div class="assign-text">
                <small>ENCAMINHADO PARA</small>
                <strong>Rafael · Corretor da região</strong>
              </div>
              <button class="btn-takeover" type="button">Assumir atendimento ↗</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="takeaway-banner">
      <p><strong>O vendedor recebe a notificação no celular</strong> e entra sabendo quem é a cliente, o imóvel, a dúvida e o próximo passo.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .qualification-section {
    padding: 90px 0;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: #fff;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .shell {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.15);
    color: #00a884;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .section-title .highlight {
    color: #4cd9a4;
  }

  .section-desc {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .section-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .col-header-tag {
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #00a884;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .col-header-tag.purple-tag {
    color: #a89cf0;
  }

  .qualification-chat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; }

  .seller-notification {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: -2px 0 14px;
    padding: 11px 12px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .96);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.2);
  }

  .notify-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 31px; height: 31px; border-radius: 8px; background: #00a884; color: #062c25; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; }
  .seller-notification small, .seller-notification strong { display: block; }
  .seller-notification small { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 8px; }
  .seller-notification strong { margin-top: 2px; font-size: 10px; }

  /* Kanban Stage Column Container (Estilo Idêntico ao Kanban da Outra Etapa) */
  .kanban-stage-column {
    background: #faf5ff;
    border: 1px solid #f3e8ff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .kanban-stage-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .stage-dot-purple {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #9333ea;
  }

  .stage-count {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 10px;
    background: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.12);
    color: #7e22ce;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  /* Single Sharp White Kanban Card */
  .kanban-deal-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .kanban-deal-card.featured-card {
    border-color: #a855f7;
  }

  .card-user-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .deal-avatar {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .card-user-row strong { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #0f172a; }
  .card-user-row small { font-size: 10px; color: #64748b; }

  .deal-tag {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .purple-tag { background: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.12); color: #7e22ce; }

  .card-summary-quote {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-left: 3px solid #00a884;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .quote-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #008f70;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .card-summary-quote p {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #334155;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-chips-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .chip {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #475569;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 5px;
  }

  .card-footer-assign {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
  }

  .assign-text small { display: block; font-size: 8.5px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 800; }
  .assign-text strong { font-size: 12.5px; color: #008f70; }

  .btn-takeover {
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #7659ef;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-takeover:hover {
    background: #5f3ee6;
  }

  .takeaway-banner {
    text-align: center;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  }

  .takeaway-banner p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #334155;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .section-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
